{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside Light Switcher\u2019s Mind is a first-person surreal puzzle adventure game where you explore the restless dreams of an overworked electrician. After long days fixing switches and circuits, his mind continues the work at night, trapping him in a mysterious dream world. Your goal is to solve light-based puzzles by changing button colors to escape and find peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756170/extras/c1a3894c13f30183c9aa50f0d3249394.poster.avif?t=1757309083\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756170/extras/c1a3894c13f30183c9aa50f0d3249394.webm?t=1757309083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756170/extras/c1a3894c13f30183c9aa50f0d3249394.mp4?t=1757309083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay &amp; Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mechanics</strong>: Interact with light switches to change colors and unlock new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong>: Tackle increasingly complex light-based riddles that test your problem-solving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story &amp; Progression</strong>: Uncover the electrician\u2019s struggle through a narrative revealed as you progress through puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: A surreal puzzle adventure with a focus on exploration and logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Elements</strong>: Experience a dreamlike atmosphere enhanced by an immersive soundtrack.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po